</div>
<p class="note"><b>Blue</b> = the Order Portal · <b>green</b> = the Production Dashboard · <b>black</b> = Zoho. Today nothing links an SH order to the SPS job that makes it; the portal writes that link (Portal Ref) on every job order it creates. v0.1 shows the customized path end to end; the stock and to-purchase choices per line arrive in v0.2.</p>
